WEBVTT

00:00.563 --> 00:01.504
The world was burning

00:29.464 --> 00:34.205
The lies were loud. We were the joke in the

00:34.265 --> 00:35.585
tabloid crowd.

00:39.046 --> 00:45.347
We had no shelter. We had no home. Just the open

00:45.387 --> 00:47.888
road and a telephone.

00:54.438 --> 01:00.183
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:00.243 --> 01:06.329
were torn. You built a place to hide from storm.

01:06.429 --> 01:10.492
You are the iron hand. You are the shield. The

01:10.532 --> 01:16.698
only army that would not yield. This is our

01:16.878 --> 01:20.962
fortress.

01:24.093 --> 01:31.019
This isn't LA. This isn't a dream. This is a

01:31.099 --> 01:37.665
warehouse. This is a scream. We're building our

01:37.725 --> 01:44.290
truth. We're building our sound. Right here on

01:44.310 --> 01:48.974
our hallowed ground. God is you.

01:52.038 --> 01:57.782
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:57.862 --> 02:01.384
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

02:01.404 --> 02:08.548
storm. You are the iron head. You are the shield.

02:08.749 --> 02:14.352
The only army that would not yield. This is our

02:14.472 --> 02:17.294
fortress.

02:52.844 --> 02:54.325
Fortress,

02:55.865 --> 02:59.247
our home

02:59.307 --> 03:04.048
We are the fortress

